      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm sorry, but this is a you issue. There is no real reason for you to sit on your ISP's current subscription in 2019. 100kbps or 0.1mbps is too low for any sort of online gaming. There is no ISP in my country that I know of that offers less than 1mbps upload speed. Gaming only needs you to have about 0.5-1mbps upload.\n\nConclusion: Get better internet. Online gaming requirements for internet connection are very low. They are very easy to meet. You're sitting on an old subscription where you possibly are paying for more than you actually get.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
