      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "having the same issue ...but my upload is 150Mbps (20-30 MBps appr)\nAny voice communication is destroyed after appr 60 seconds after joining a world (even if it is only other 1 user) all other audio channels are normal so it s the voice system that messed up, already being 20 support mail back and forth and no fix thusfar, hoping it gets fixed in Unity 2018 VRC cause the chat is now removed from VRChat for me",
