      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c9c38d3f6dbdf157dcd507a|full_name}: Late reply but in reality you cannot get a better connection without a business ISP connection. This game used to work without any issues until it removed it's servers and forced every player to use peer-peer communication which when there's >20 players requires high upload speed.",
