  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-10-12T10:43:27.830Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The update from a few months ago changed the voice system to upload your player voice to EVERYONE in the room and overloads my 100kbps upload speed!\nThis previously wasn't an issue as the last voice system only sent voice to nearby players. However in large rooms >20 players typically it causes voice to completely break.\nEven if safety settings you block everyone except friends. I want either voice to be fixed or safety settings voice options to reflect who recieves your voice audio.",
